{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>We Who Rise</strong></i> is a fast-paced vertical platformer that's all about quick reflexes, tight movement, and the simple joy of beating your own high score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The climb won't be easy. Every step upwards throws something new at you: spikes, saw-blades, narrow gaps, spears. On top of that, if you stand still too long or hesitate, you'll be swallowed by the bottom of the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no shortcuts here, no checkpoints to bail you out. You've got three hearts, and every mistake costs you. But each platform you conquer adds to your score, and every run is a chance to climb higher and push a little further. Whether you have five minutes or an hour, it's easy to jump in, make a run for it, and see how far your skills can take you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't about a grand quest or saving a kingdom... it's about simple, satisfying gameplay: pure movement, high-stakes jumps, and the thrill of outdoing yourself. Just you, the climb, and the endless chase for a new personal best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880600/extras/edbb9584e2e249d2ca4b44b85726216a.avif?t=1773479021\" width=600 height=51 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, Responsive Climbing</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge traps, time your jumps, and stay ahead of the rising screen in an arcade-style tower climb.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score-Driven Progression</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach new heights, earn points, and keep pushing your best score higher with every run.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Room to Recover</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With three hearts, a single mistake won't end your run, but you'll need to stay sharp to keep going.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Constant Upward Pressure</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fall behind or wait too long, it's game over. The climb waits for no one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880600/extras/edbb9584e2e249d2ca4b44b85726216a.avif?t=1773479021\" width=600 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no final boss, no enemies, no treasure at the top... just pure climbing and the endless challenge of reaching higher than before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the nerve to rise again... and again... and again?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only question is...\u00a0<strong>How High Can You Go?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3880600?t=1773479021","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880600/d216dbd725f9485ad80b9301bfa272475f370f6b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773479021","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880600/4e264f217255b0eb61f443935473765dda311f72/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773479021","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880600/4e264f217255b0eb61f443935473765dda311f72/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773479021","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3881850,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>We Who Rise</strong></i> is a fast-paced vertical platformer that's all about quick reflexes, tight movement, and the simple joy of beating your own high score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The climb won't be easy. Every step upwards throws something new at you: spikes, saw-blades, narrow gaps, spears. On top of that, if you stand still too long or hesitate, you'll be swallowed by the bottom of the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no shortcuts here, no checkpoints to bail you out. You've got three hearts, and every mistake costs you. But each platform you conquer adds to your score, and every run is a chance to climb higher and push a little further. Whether you have five minutes or an hour, it's easy to jump in, make a run for it, and see how far your skills can take you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't about a grand quest or saving a kingdom... it's about simple, satisfying gameplay: pure movement, high-stakes jumps, and the thrill of outdoing yourself. Just you, the climb, and the endless chase for a new personal best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880600/extras/edbb9584e2e249d2ca4b44b85726216a.avif?t=1773479021\" width=600 height=51 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, Responsive Climbing</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge traps, time your jumps, and stay ahead of the rising screen in an arcade-style tower climb.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score-Driven Progression</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach new heights, earn points, and keep pushing your best score higher with every run.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Room to Recover</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With three hearts, a single mistake won't end your run, but you'll need to stay sharp to keep going.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Constant Upward Pressure</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fall behind or wait too long, it's game over. The climb waits for no one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880600/extras/edbb9584e2e249d2ca4b44b85726216a.avif?t=1773479021\" width=600 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no final boss, no enemies, no treasure at the top... just pure climbing and the endless challenge of reaching higher than before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the nerve to rise again... and again... and again?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only question is...\u00a0<strong>How High Can You Go?</strong></p>","developers":["Nox Nauta Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880600/a5909f1f96adfb7b4a498902a278e214acadb571/header.jpg?t=1773479021","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3880600/101681492/c7a0db22bfd35527e91a1245344b068cdffc9c54/1773478513/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773479020","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.st